OL,3,GNEWSARising energy costs add to cost of
OL,4,Aliving for Northern Ireland's consumers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds across Northern Ireland face
OL,7,Fincreasing pressure on the cost of
OL,8,Fliving as energy price hikes have come
OL,9,Finto effect.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's largest provider of
OL,12,Fnatural gas, SSE Airtricity, increased
OL,13,Fits prices by almost 19% on Thursday
OL,14,Ffor its 200,000 domestic and small
OL,15,Fbusiness customers.
OL,17,FThat means the annual gas bill of a
OL,18,Ftypical household in the greater
OL,19,FBelfast and west gas network areas will
OL,20,Fincrease by almost #172.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
