OL,4,Aliving for Northern Ireland's consumers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said "unprecedented levels
OL,7,Fof volatility in global energy markets
OL,8,Fand higher wholesale gas prices" had
OL,9,Fled to the price rise.
